Subject: [PATCH 5/7] single type per file: additional types moved to their own
 files (type-check follows; Linux x86_64, Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 Sources/Division/Division.Error.swift  | 14 ++++++++++++++
 Sources/Division/Division.Signed.swift |  9 +++++++++
